#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0214 expect=noViolation domain=TE
#note "Each Element populates TEENRL, or TEDUR, or both, so the sheet's 'at least one of TEENRL and TEDUR must be populated' is satisfied on every row. All three arms exercised deliberately."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
col TEENRL  type=Char label="Rule for End of Element"
col TEDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Element"
---
S1 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent | End of screening   | 
S1 | TE | TRT  | Treatment | First dose       |                    | P14D
S1 | TE | FUP  | Follow-up | Last dose        | End of follow-up   | P28D
---
